---
description: Require actor attribution in PR workflow artifacts
alwaysApply: true
---

# PR Action Attribution

- For PR workflow actions, always capture the acting user identity in artifacts and summaries:
  - `Action-By: @<github_username>`
  - `GitHub-Profile: https://github.com/<github_username>`
- Use role-specific labels where applicable:
  - review phase: `Reviewed-By: @<github_username>`
  - prepare phase: `Prepared-By: @<github_username>`
  - merge phase: `Merged-By: @<github_username>`
- The username must represent the person who performed that specific action.
- Apply this to `.local/review.md`, `.local/prep.md`, and `.local/merge.md`.
